  (text "Light controller for the drone-show quad: RP2350A + RM2 Wi-Fi, 12 Cree XP-E2 LEDs (3 per colour, R/G/B/W) on the bottom side," (at 25.4 395 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 751706f8-732e-5fb8-9e26-dec4809149da))
  (text "four AL8860 constant-current buck drivers, 4S-6S input. LED current = 0.1 V / Rsense = 0.67 A with 0.15 ohm (1.0 A max with 0.1 ohm)." (at 25.4 400.08 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 12d15c20-e4c9-5054-8e15-d92f19f0915e))
  (text "GPIO23/24/25/29 drive the RM2 exactly as on a Pico 2 W, so the pico2_w board definition and cyw43 driver work unchanged." (at 25.4 405.16 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6301faf4-451c-51e1-b9c5-1865e361561f))
  (text "CTRL pull-downs keep the LEDs dark while the RP2350 boots. Fit C51-C54 only for filtered (analog) dimming." (at 25.4 410.24 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5fac1856-49a5-5cb6-ad62-c48317f9164b))
